<title>BRAZIL: Brazil national strike to start at 0700 local Fri.</title>
<headline>Brazil national strike to start at 0700 local Fri.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>A 48-hour national strike by Brazilian stevedores will begin at 0700 local/1000 GMT Friday, and not at midnight Thursday as originally stated, an official at the National Stevedores' Union said.</p>
<p>&quot;The strike will start at 0700 local and will last for two days,&quot; said Ernani Duarte, secretary-general of the union.</p>
<p>An official at the Santos Stevedores' Union on Tuesday said the strike would start at midnight Thursday and last 48 hours.</p>
<p>((--Joelle Diderich, Sao Paulo newsroom +55 11 248 5417))</p>
